<title>USA: O'Hare Airport $218 mln bonds yld 6.10 pct in 2018.</title>
<headline>O'Hare Airport $218 mln bonds yld 6.10 pct in 2018.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
